  "draft_py": "# Flame Sweep: \"Flame Sweep deals 2 damage to each creature except for creatures you\n# control with flying.\"  The compiler emits no abilities for this instant, so the\n# SpellAbility carrier holds the effect.\nspell = SpellAbility(\n    kind=SpellKind.INSTANT,\n    effect=A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n        'amount': QConst(value=2),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                FNot(inner=FAnd(children=(\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.KEYWORD_HAS, keyword=Keyword.FLYING),\n                ))),\n            )),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [spell]\n",
